From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP Folia async brain + end-vehicle spawn

Villager updateActivityFromSchedule is deferred while EntityType.create runs
on the origin region thread (Folia #446). Vehicle END→overworld uses the
riding player's respawn, not world spawn (Folia #453).
Post-applyAllPatches.
